  "label": "Wealth and Confidence Stereotype",
  "description": "The man's luxurious attire (fur coat, hat) and confident pose are used to imply that he is wealthy and powerful, which contrasts with the misogynistic text. This juxtaposition reinforces the stereotype that men who are wealthy and confident can afford to be dismissive of women's worth, while also implying that such men are entitled to treat women as objects.",
